+At i form the24-entry tagged list F_i from G_i,G_(i+1),G_(i+2),G_(i+3).
+Define eta(i,y)=min_(tag,p in F_i) f_p(y). It is real and periodic in[0,1]
+and zero within transverse radius2 of every ACTUAL refined corner at i.
+Squared maximum<=sum and(1) give
+ ||1-eta||_X^2<=4*4*6*V/L^2.                              (3)
+Match F_i to F_(i+1): the designated18 shared entries stay fixed, while
