+Each P component has absolute coefficient sum<=8, x1 shift0 and transverse
+radius<=3. The no-longitudinal version of(4) gives
+ ||P(etaPsi0)-eta*z0||^2<=73728*n*4*6/L.                   (5)
+Each derivative component has coefficient sum<=16. Transverse derivatives
+have radius<=4; x1 derivatives have longitudinal shifts0/1 and transverse
