+No source weight or coexact domain is shifted by these estimates.
+
+Splitting z1-z0=(eta-1)z0+[P(etaPsi0)-eta z0], using(3),(5) and n<=V,
+ ||z1-z0||^2 <= (64*4*6/L^2+147456*4*6/L)V.              (7)
+Condition(T), with A>=16*4, implies L>=2^22*4*6. The coefficient in(7)
+is<=2^-38+9/256<2, so ||z1||>sqrt(8V)-sqrt(2V)=sqrt(2V).
+The FIELD is nonzero. Multiplying(6) by H=cn^2 and using(T),
+ Q_strong<=98304*c*V*6*A/L<=3cV/8<3c||z1||^2/16.
+All directional forward difference norms are<=2||z1||; consequently
+Q_weak<=12a||z1||^2=c||z1||^2/4. This proves the claimed7c/16 bound.
+All original means are zero so any finite quadratic observation penalty
